                              <p class=3D"oj-normal">4.</p>
                           </td>
                           <td valign=3D"top">
                              <p class=3D"oj-normal">I artikel&nbsp;35.2 sk=
a f=C3=B6ljande led inf=C3=B6ras:</p>
