                           <td valign=3D"top">
                              <p class=3D"oj-normal">I artikel&nbsp;36 ska =
f=C3=B6ljande punkt inf=C3=B6ras:</p>
                              <div id=3D"036.003A">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">=E2=80=9D3a.&nbsp;&=
